<title>USA: National-Standard Co Q4 Sept 30 net up.</title>
<headline>National-Standard Co Q4 Sept 30 net up.</headline>
<dateline>NILES, Mich. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>($000 except per share amounts)</p>
<p> For three months ended September 30:     1996	    1995</p>
<p> Net Sales					 61,154	  62,254</p>
<p> Operating Income				 1,345	   2,906</p>
<p> Net Income					 1,629	   1,579</p>
<p> Income Per Share				   .30	     .29</p>
<p> Average Shares Outstanding	     5,333,283     5,382,517</p>
<p> For year ended September 30:		 1996	    1995</p>
<p> Net Sales				     $248,554	$247,420</p>
<p> Operating Income				 8,871	  12,924</p>
<p> Net Income					 8,852	   7,350</p>
<p> Income Per Share				  1.65	    1.37</p>
<p> Average Shares Outstanding	     5,357,697     5,372,694</p>
<p>NOTE: Fiscal 1996 net income includes about $3.5 million from sale of Allmerica Financial Corp shares.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
